      <ol start="2"><li></li></ol>
      <ul><li>Cloning is not supported on hyperdisk-balanced disks with storage pools.</li></ul>
      <ol start="3"><li></li></ol>
      <ul><li>Does not support offline snapshots or resize. Volume must be attached to a running pod.</li></ul>
      <ol start="4"><li></li></ol>
      <ul><li>RBD supports user namespaces; CephFS does not.</li></ul>
      <ol start="5"><li></li></ol>
      <ul>
      <li>Requires VMware vSphere version 8.0 Update 1 or later, or VMware vSphere Foundation (VVF) 9, or VMware Cloud Foundation (VCF) 9, for both vCenter Server and ESXi.</li>
      <li>Does not support fileshare volumes.</li>
      </ul>
      <ol start="6"><li></li></ol>
      <ul><li>Online expansion is supported from VMware vSphere version 8.0 Update 1 and later, or VVF 9, or VCF 9.</li></ul>
      <ol start="7"><li></li></ol>
      <ul><li>File persistent volumes (PVs), such as vSAN file service, do not support user namespaces.</li></ul>
